:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Dancer Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Kung Fu Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and can be purchased for 240 [[Cat Food]] in the [[Upgrade Menu]] after completing [[Jamaica (Empire of Cats)|Jamaica]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. In [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]], [[True Form]] increases range and grants [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken Immunity]], but has a slower attack animation. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he is unlocked from clearing Calabash in chapter 3 and costs 21000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he is unlocked in Jamaica in the Empire of Cats chapter and costs 120 Cat Food.

